---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import applePlanting from "../assets/images/apple-planting.jpg";
import compostTeaching from "../assets/images/compost-teaching.jpg";
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-eden-sand">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Text -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-eden-green mb-6">
          Our Philosophy
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-eden-dark/80 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            At Faju Eden, everything starts with the soil. We believe that
            healthy soil produces healthy crops — and healthy crops nourish
            healthy communities.
          </p>
          <p>
            Through vermicomposting and organic practices, we build living
            soil that sustains our diverse farm. No chemical fertilizers, no
            shortcuts — just patience, care, and a deep respect for the land.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our farm is more than a place to grow food. It's a classroom, a
            community hub, and a living example of what sustainable
            agriculture can look like in Kakamega.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Photos -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <Image
          src={applePlanting}
          alt="Planting seedlings in prepared soil"
          width={400}
          class="rounded-xl shadow-md object-cover aspect-[3/4]"
        />
        <Image
          src={compostTeaching}
          alt="Teaching vermicomposting techniques"
          width={400}
          class="rounded-xl shadow-md object-cover aspect-[3/4] mt-8"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
